ntryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rds" target="stby"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5a" value="5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=0.8036;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ng" target="nat"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5b" value="5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nat" target="sm"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6a" value="6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s3" target="sqs"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6b" value="6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sqs" target="ing"><mxGeometry x="0.1" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1320" y="520"/><mxPoint x="1320" y="705"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="gh" target="cb"><mxGeometry x="-0.5" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cb" target="cp"><mxGeometry x="0.3" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="630" y="950"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9a" value="9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="owner" target="bas"><mxGeometry x="-0.5" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9b" value="9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bas" target="cp"><mxGeometry x="0.3" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="540" y="1060"/><mxPoint x="540" y="1210"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lbc" target="alb"><mxGeometry x="0.2" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="300" y="705"/><mxPoint x="300" y="395"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt; Browser to the internet-facing ALB over HTTPS 443 with the Cognito ID token (Route 53 weights decide which backend answers; HTTP 80 only redirects).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt; The ALB validates the token signature, issuer, aud and token_use against the Cognito JWKS endpoint (outbound 443).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt; The ALB forwards valid requests to the pods (IP targets, HTTPS with a self-signed pod certificate).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt; Pods reach the database only through RDS Proxy (TLS, application secret), which pools connections to RDS PostgreSQL; the standby is Multi-AZ in prod only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt; Pods call AWS APIs (Secrets Manager, SNS, ECR, Logs, STS) through the NAT gateway; S3 uses a free gateway endpoint.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt; An object created under incoming/ with suffix .csv sends an S3 event to SQS; the ingestion worker long-polls the queue; failures go to the DLQ and raise an alarm.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt; GitHub Actions authenticates with OIDC (no static keys) and starts the CodeBuild project, which runs inside the VPC.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt; CodeBuild runs helm against the private cluster API (443, cluster admin access entry) to install the charts and the controllers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt; The owner opens a Session Manager session to the bastion (no inbound rule, no SSH, no public IP) and runs read-only kubectl (view access entry).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt; The AWS Load Balancer Controller creates and maintains the ALB, listeners and target groups from the Ingress.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; Kubernetes 1.37 (newest at creation), standard support, authentication mode API (access entries, no aws-auth), Pod Identity roles per workload, network policies deny by default. Nodes t4g.medium arm64 on-demand, gp3 20 GB encrypted, IMDSv2 hop limit 1; HPA 1 to 4 replicas on CPU 50 percent. RDS db.t4g.micro gp3 20 GB with a customer key, TLS forced, IAM database authentication off; backups 1 day in dev, 15 days in prod with deletion protection; secrets rotate every 3 days. ALB policy ELBSecurityPolicy-TLS13-1-2-2021-06, invalid headers dropped, access logs to an SSE-S3 bucket. dev has one NAT gateway deleted 22:00-08:00 Panama time (nodes cannot pull images and pods cannot read secrets while it is down; running pods keep serving); prod keeps one NAT per AZ always on, adds the WAF, the Multi-AZ standby and VPC flow logs. Log retention 14 days dev, 90 days prod; about 20 alarms notify one SNS topic. Maximum CSV size 5 MB. Exceptions: no WAF in dev; tokens are not re-validated inside the pods; the CodeBuild role is cluster admin. Dashed items exist only in prod or belong to other repositories. Pods reference the image by digest; the CodeBuild source is checked by SHA-256; TLS to the database is verified; AWS Health events for EKS and a weekly reminder go to the alerts topic." style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="1350" width="1420" height="305" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>